scenario: async-reset-cancelled
A         committed SET search_path; the block then exits normally                             done
A         connection returned; the 0.5 s reset runs in the pool's worker                       done
A         task cancelled 0.3 s in                                                              CancelledError
observer  A's uncommitted insert after the return                                              not visible
B         same physical session as A                                                           True
B         search_path                                                                          "$user", public
observer  where B's committed insert landed                                                    public
